I make my first dinner in my own kitchen.
It is a very simple dinner.
Nina and I eat together at the little table.
There are two plates and two cups on the table.
The bread is also lying on the table.
The lamp stands by the window.
It is very cozy.
The food is good.
I look around my new apartment.
I am really happy.
"Welcome home, Maya," says Nina.
"Thank you very much," I say and look at her.
We raise our cups and smile at each other.
